# Services Agreement

This Agreement is made between Lowfield Cleaning Ltd (the "Supplier") and Marrick Offices Ltd (the "Customer").

## 3. Payment
3.1 The Customer shall pay each invoice within 30 days.

## 5. Payment
5.1 The Supplier shall pay any service credits within 14 days.

## 6. Insurance
6.1 The Supplier shall maintain public liability insurance.
